-- SECTION 1: SCHWARTZ-BRUHAT SPACE S(Z_2 x Z_2) & EXACT WALSH-HADAMARD FOURIER
--   G = Z_2 x Z_2 (|G| = 4), self-dual Pontryagin dual G^ = G!
--   Unnormalized Hadamard Fourier transform H_4:
--     f^(0) = f0 + f1 + f2 + f3
--     f^(1) = f0 - f1 + f2 - f3
--     f^(2) = f0 + f1 - f2 - f3
--     f^(3) = f0 - f1 - f2 + f3
--   Exact inversion: H_4(H_4(f)) == 4 * f  (over Q: (1/2) H_4 is STRICTLY INVOLUTIVE UNITARY!)
